Here’s a single‑file HTML page that meets all the requirements:

* **Black background** – `body` has `background:#000`.
* **No scrolling** – `height:100vh` and no overflow.
* **Video in the background** – `<video>` placed at the top.
* **Hero heading** – “Explore Zeroh” in huge bold white text.
* **Button “Join Waitlist”** – sits under the heading, starts faded (transparent background, white outline) and turns into a full white button with black text on hover.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Explore Zeroh</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #000;          /* black background */
    height: 100vh;                   /* prevent scrolling */
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  video {
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 600px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  .waitlist-btn {
    background: none;               /* transparent background */
    border: 2px solid #fff;         /* white outline */
    color: #fff;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    margin-top: 15px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .waitlist-btn:hover {
    opacity: 1;                     /* fade out → become visible */
    border-color: #000;            /* turn outline black */
    color: #000;                   /* black text */
    background: #fff;              /* full white button */
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Background video -->
  <video id="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video>

  <div class="hero">
    <h1 class="title">Explore Zeroh</h1>
    <p>Join us now!</p>
    <button class="waitlist-btn">Join Waitlist</button>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
```

### How it works
* **`body`** sets the entire page to a solid black colour and fixes its height (`100vh`) so nothing scrolls.
* The `<video>` element provides the background visual.
* The heading `.title` uses `font-size: 4rem` and `color:#fff` for large bold white text.
* The button `.waitlist-btn`:
  * Starts with `background:none`, a thin white border, and white text (`#fff`).
  * Has a smooth transition on `opacity` and `border-color`.
  * On hover (`:hover`) the styles switch to a full white background, black text, and a black border – giving the “full white button with black text” appearance.

Just save the code as an `.html` file and open it in a browser. Enjoy your non‑scrollable, video‑backed landing page!

